{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>I will ascend.</b> This verse is joined to what follows it: you said, 'I will ascend above the heights of cloud.'" "<b>I will be like.</b> From the hitpa'el conjugation, the tav assimilated, the proof being the dagesh in the mem."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:44.506063100Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}